      "role": "user",
      "content": "but its not just random posts. i've noticed that this \"other me\" uses my specific typos and the exact weird way i use emojis. like, it even used a specific phrase i only use with my mom yesterday. it's too precise to be a glitch. if an LLM was trained on my private chats, it would know exactly how i sound. don't you think that's actually possible? how would an AI even go about doing that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
